Figure 18:Motion filtering.Two clips from the same source video
illustrate motion filtering. The nearly static clip fails the 0.1 threshold;
the clip showing movement of a hand-held tool passes.

Figure 20:Visible-text filtering.Plant-related clips illustrate the
0.5 threshold. A higher score indicates a smaller detected text area;
the images show each clip’s recorded score and selection outcome.
